// 节流处理：只将符合刷新率的最新帧发布给 UI，其余帧仅归还硬件，防止 19 万 fps 打崩 UI
if (elapsedSincePublish >= refreshIntervalSec) {
    lastPublishTime = now;

    auto frame = framePool_.acquire(config.binCount);
    if (frame) {
        const auto* rawData = reinterpret_cast<const int32_t*>(
            static_cast<const char*>(mapBase) + info.index * RTSA_BUFFER_SIZE);
        const float fullScale = config.fullScaleMagnitude > 0.0f
            ? config.fullScaleMagnitude
            : 2147483648.0f;
        const std::size_t binCount = config.binCount;
        const bool fftShift = config.enableFftShift;
        const std::size_t half = binCount / 2;

        for (std::size_t i = 0; i < binCount; ++i) {
            const std::size_t srcIdx = fftShift ? ((i + half) % binCount) : i;
            const float mag = std::abs(static_cast<float>(rawData[srcIdx]));
            // 转换为 dBFS：20 * log10(|val| / 2^31)
            frame->bins[i] = (mag > 1.0f)
                ? (20.0f * std::log10(mag / fullScale))
                : -140.0f;
        }

        frame->metadata.sequence = info.sequence;
        frame->metadata.timestampNs = info.timestamp_ns;
        frame->metadata.centerFrequencyHz = config.centerFrequencyHz;
        frame->metadata.spanHz = config.spanHz;
        frame->metadata.binCount = static_cast<std::uint32_t>(binCount);
        frame->metadata.unit = AmplitudeUnit::Dbfs;
        frame->metadata.calibrated = false;

        if (sink) {
            sink(frame);
        }
    }
}

